WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.240
Today, I'm going to teach you how to

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:06.360
become so dangerously intuitive that you

00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:08.640
freak people out because your intuition

00:00:06.360 --> 00:00:10.480
is always right and whatever is out

00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:12.520
there that's profiting from you not

00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:14.120
talking to your higher self does not

00:00:12.520 --> 00:00:16.440
want you to become more intuitive

00:00:14.120 --> 00:00:18.880
because you being trapped in a box makes

00:00:16.440 --> 00:00:21.000
you a great servant to the world. They

00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:23.080
want you trapped in your ego, in your

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:25.200
fear, in your shame, and your pride, and

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:27.120
you're being programmed all the time by

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:29.280
everything. Your job, your family,

00:00:27.120 --> 00:00:31.320
politics, the algorithms telling you

00:00:29.280 --> 00:00:33.520
what to think and what to feel. You've

00:00:31.320 --> 00:00:35.760
gotten so good at picking up all kinds

00:00:33.520 --> 00:00:37.880
of external opinions and doing the

00:00:35.760 --> 00:00:39.320
function that you stopped talking to

00:00:37.880 --> 00:00:41.800
your higher self. That's why you're

00:00:39.320 --> 00:00:43.880
always seeking external validation to

00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:46.040
the point where some of you don't even

00:00:43.880 --> 00:00:49.080
know what your intuition sounds like.

00:00:46.040 --> 00:00:51.360
So, when I say dangerously intuitive, I

00:00:49.080 --> 00:00:53.480
mean dangerous to the systems that

00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:55.920
profit from you staying confused. So,

00:00:53.480 --> 00:00:57.800
today, I'm going to show you how to cut

00:00:55.920 --> 00:00:59.400
through the noise, stop second-guessing

00:00:57.800 --> 00:01:01.400
yourself, and stop outsourcing your

00:00:59.400 --> 00:01:02.640
thoughts. My channel is all about

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.280
transforming your mind, body, and

00:01:02.640 --> 00:01:06.040
spirit, and if you're into it, you can

00:01:04.280 --> 00:01:08.000
join us if you want. You're already

00:01:06.040 --> 00:01:10.400
intuitive, by the way, but I'm here only

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:11.960
to remind you how to hear it and how to

00:01:10.400 --> 00:01:13.760
use it. And then, you can take that

00:01:11.960 --> 00:01:16.120
intuition and communicate with it and

00:01:13.760 --> 00:01:19.360
form your opinions and nuances and

00:01:16.120 --> 00:01:19.360
critical analysis.

00:01:19.920 --> 00:01:23.280
So, this is why you can't hear it

00:01:21.120 --> 00:01:25.280
anymore. Most of us lost our intuition

00:01:23.280 --> 00:01:27.760
somewhere between our childhood and

00:01:25.280 --> 00:01:29.480
becoming functioning adults. You learn

00:01:27.760 --> 00:01:32.400
that you were inconveniencing other

00:01:29.480 --> 00:01:34.480
people. You need to not be a certain way

00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:36.520
and that the safest thing to do is to

00:01:34.480 --> 00:01:39.400
become a certain type of person so that

00:01:36.520 --> 00:01:41.480
you're very easy to deal with and that's

00:01:39.400 --> 00:01:43.440
how you can find your superficial

00:01:41.480 --> 00:01:45.600
success. Let's just call it that. You

00:01:43.440 --> 00:01:47.440
become so good at learning what other

00:01:45.600 --> 00:01:49.320
people want from you that you don't even

00:01:47.440 --> 00:01:50.760
know what you want. That's why so many

00:01:49.320 --> 00:01:52.440
people out there are miserable and they

00:01:50.760 --> 00:01:54.480
feel trapped. And then, we add the

00:01:52.440 --> 00:01:56.040
internet, social media, and guys,

00:01:54.480 --> 00:01:58.240
disclaimer, I know I live on the

00:01:56.040 --> 00:02:00.080
internet, too, but like discernment and

00:01:58.240 --> 00:02:02.320
nuance is everything. Form your own

00:02:00.080 --> 00:02:04.720
opinions, critical analysis, and your

00:02:02.320 --> 00:02:06.479
intuition builds that discernment. For

00:02:04.720 --> 00:02:08.240
most people, your intuition is just

00:02:06.479 --> 00:02:09.920
buried under all of these layers of

00:02:08.240 --> 00:02:11.880
noise, so you don't even know how to

00:02:09.920 --> 00:02:13.880
hear it or to even trust yourself. It's

00:02:11.880 --> 00:02:16.000
almost like your inner guide or your

00:02:13.880 --> 00:02:17.680
higher selves is whispering to you, but

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:19.120
your head is like a nightclub, and you

00:02:17.680 --> 00:02:21.240
can't hear it. So, we're not even

00:02:19.120 --> 00:02:24.040
developing even more intuition, but

00:02:21.240 --> 00:02:25.720
instead creating more silence and ways

00:02:24.040 --> 00:02:28.360
to filter it out so you can actually

00:02:25.720 --> 00:02:28.360
hear it.

00:02:28.920 --> 00:02:33.400
So, what is intuition like? Your

00:02:31.080 --> 00:02:35.680
intuition can come through symbolically

00:02:33.400 --> 00:02:37.880
and not always literally. It may not

00:02:35.680 --> 00:02:39.760
always feel logical, and it's very

00:02:37.880 --> 00:02:42.560
quiet, but it helps you feel more

00:02:39.760 --> 00:02:45.000
connected to yourself, to nature, to

00:02:42.560 --> 00:02:48.200
interconnectedness and oneness, and it

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:50.240
feels loving and supportive, not mean or

00:02:48.200 --> 00:02:53.080
judgemental, because your higher selves

00:02:50.240 --> 00:02:54.440
will never be mean to you or shame you.

00:02:53.080 --> 00:02:56.959
So, learn to tell the difference,

00:02:54.440 --> 00:02:59.640
because that's your ego talking. Ego is

00:02:56.959 --> 00:03:01.560
loud, it's proud, and it's obsessive.

00:02:59.640 --> 00:03:03.640
And your ego constantly makes you doubt

00:03:01.560 --> 00:03:05.720
yourself. It separates you from other

00:03:03.640 --> 00:03:07.840
people. It makes you worry all the time,

00:03:05.720 --> 00:03:09.840
and it tries to keep you in a box, and

00:03:07.840 --> 00:03:11.880
it does not want you to leave that box.

00:03:09.840 --> 00:03:13.519
So, it makes you basically see the world

00:03:11.880 --> 00:03:16.080
in fear. There are different kinds of

00:03:13.519 --> 00:03:18.080
intuition, like the instinctual gut

00:03:16.080 --> 00:03:19.840
feeling that you feel in your stomach,

00:03:18.080 --> 00:03:22.560
emotional intuition, where you feel it

00:03:19.840 --> 00:03:24.239
in your chest, mental claircognizance,

00:03:22.560 --> 00:03:26.400
which is when your entire being just

00:03:24.239 --> 00:03:27.920
knows something. And that's personally

00:03:26.400 --> 00:03:29.959
what I have a lot of. There's also

00:03:27.920 --> 00:03:31.840
creative intuition, which is basically

00:03:29.959 --> 00:03:33.720
flow state. There's spiritual intuition,

00:03:31.840 --> 00:03:36.040
which is connected to your higher selves

00:03:33.720 --> 00:03:38.360
and higher purpose. Social intuition,

00:03:36.040 --> 00:03:41.000
which is empathy. Picking up energies,

00:03:38.360 --> 00:03:42.959
empaths, and people pleasers are so good

00:03:41.000 --> 00:03:45.040
at this form of intuition, so that they

00:03:42.959 --> 00:03:47.280
can learn to anticipate other people's

00:03:45.040 --> 00:03:50.239
needs, sometimes to a fault. And then

00:03:47.280 --> 00:03:52.760
lastly, your body's own somatic wisdom.

00:03:50.239 --> 00:03:54.600
Athletes talk about this. Knowing when

00:03:52.760 --> 00:03:56.080
to rest, sensing when you're about to

00:03:54.600 --> 00:03:59.280
get sick before you even have any kind

00:03:56.080 --> 00:03:59.280
of symptoms show up.

00:03:59.720 --> 00:04:02.720
So now I'm going to give you very

00:04:01.160 --> 00:04:04.440
specific tools and practices that you

00:04:02.720 --> 00:04:06.360
can start today. First of all, learn to

00:04:04.440 --> 00:04:09.080
quiet your mind because your intuition

00:04:06.360 --> 00:04:10.560
speaks in whispers. It's very soft. If

00:04:09.080 --> 00:04:12.440
your mind is constantly loud with

00:04:10.560 --> 00:04:14.480
worrying, plans, other people's

00:04:12.440 --> 00:04:15.800
opinions, you're going to miss it. So

00:04:14.480 --> 00:04:17.519
you have to learn how to sit with

00:04:15.800 --> 00:04:19.200
yourself in silence, even if it's

00:04:17.519 --> 00:04:21.640
boring. Boring is great. You can

00:04:19.200 --> 00:04:23.080
meditate for even 5 minutes and spend

00:04:21.640 --> 00:04:25.880
time in nature without your phone. No

00:04:23.080 --> 00:04:28.040
podcast, no Spotify. You and the sounds

00:04:25.880 --> 00:04:30.120
of nature, that's it. This reminds me of

00:04:28.040 --> 00:04:31.480
the movie Apocalypto in the first scene.

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:34.480
movie is based in the ancient Mayan

00:04:31.480 --> 00:04:36.680
times where the main character can sense

00:04:34.480 --> 00:04:38.960
immediately that something is wrong even

00:04:36.680 --> 00:04:41.360
when his tribe couldn't because he's so

00:04:38.960 --> 00:04:43.680
connected to himself and to nature. And

00:04:41.360 --> 00:04:46.640
then he started to lose that intuition

00:04:43.680 --> 00:04:48.360
because of fear and insecurity, the ego

00:04:46.640 --> 00:04:50.840
that began to develop in his head.

00:04:48.360 --> 00:04:52.600
Meditation also quiet down that ego and

00:04:50.840 --> 00:04:55.120
gives you more of your energy back, more

00:04:52.600 --> 00:04:56.880
of yourself back. I know it may not seem

00:04:55.120 --> 00:04:58.520
like much, but I promise you

00:04:56.880 --> 00:05:00.640
self-awareness to the point where I can

00:04:58.520 --> 00:05:02.120
literally separate my own thoughts from

00:05:00.640 --> 00:05:04.080
the external world so much better

00:05:02.120 --> 00:05:06.040
because of it. Things that feel true to

00:05:04.080 --> 00:05:08.000
you, trusting that the answer will come

00:05:06.040 --> 00:05:10.240
to you, and then letting it come

00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:11.640
through. Body scans. Your intuition

00:05:10.240 --> 00:05:13.560
doesn't just live in your conscious

00:05:11.640 --> 00:05:15.680
head, but mostly in your body. That's

00:05:13.560 --> 00:05:17.440
why we call it gut feeling. And this can

00:05:15.680 --> 00:05:19.440
feel like nervousness in your stomach or

00:05:17.440 --> 00:05:21.440
even tension in your chest, an inner

00:05:19.440 --> 00:05:23.480
knowing that something is off, and a

00:05:21.440 --> 00:05:25.080
physical feeling of ease and comfort

00:05:23.480 --> 00:05:26.640
when something is going really well. And

00:05:25.080 --> 00:05:29.440
that's your intuition telling you

00:05:26.640 --> 00:05:32.160
something. So throughout your day, pause

00:05:29.440 --> 00:05:34.720
and scan your body. Meaning notice every

00:05:32.160 --> 00:05:36.160
single body part from head to toe, one

00:05:34.720 --> 00:05:37.840
at a time. And there's also a lot of

00:05:36.160 --> 00:05:40.480
great meditations that focus on body

00:05:37.840 --> 00:05:42.360
scans. So before you make a decision,

00:05:40.480 --> 00:05:44.080
check in with your body. What does your

00:05:42.360 --> 00:05:46.600
posture look like? Are you getting

00:05:44.080 --> 00:05:48.840
smaller or bigger? And what does your

00:05:46.600 --> 00:05:51.240
stomach or your chest or your shoulders

00:05:48.840 --> 00:05:53.280
telling you? Your body holds onto

00:05:51.240 --> 00:05:55.120
memories that you forgot and knows

00:05:53.280 --> 00:05:57.280
things that your mind hasn't figured out

00:05:55.120 --> 00:05:58.920
yet. So, start to quiet down and learn

00:05:57.280 --> 00:06:00.680
to trust your physical body. And then

00:05:58.920 --> 00:06:02.160
when you do certain things like box

00:06:00.680 --> 00:06:04.120
breathing, like inhaling for four

00:06:02.160 --> 00:06:05.680
counts, holding for four counts, and

00:06:04.120 --> 00:06:07.800
then exhaling for four, and then holding

00:06:05.680 --> 00:06:09.440
for four again, you start to calm your

00:06:07.800 --> 00:06:11.040
nerves down. It's a great tool to

00:06:09.440 --> 00:06:12.600
connect with your body. I also love to

00:06:11.040 --> 00:06:14.600
journal my dreams. I actually have a

00:06:12.600 --> 00:06:16.840
specific dream channel on my Stoic

00:06:14.600 --> 00:06:18.360
Angels Discord community because I like

00:06:16.840 --> 00:06:20.960
to encourage people to remember their

00:06:18.360 --> 00:06:22.840
dreams better. We really should not be

00:06:20.960 --> 00:06:24.560
dismissing our dreams as some kind of

00:06:22.840 --> 00:06:26.760
random brain activity. And your

00:06:24.560 --> 00:06:29.720
daydreams are also not a distraction

00:06:26.760 --> 00:06:31.560
either, but truly these are doorways to

00:06:29.720 --> 00:06:33.560
your subconscious mind. If certain

00:06:31.560 --> 00:06:35.200
things keep popping up in your head and

00:06:33.560 --> 00:06:38.120
you start having vivid imagery,

00:06:35.200 --> 00:06:39.840
flashbacks, recurring dreams, and random

00:06:38.120 --> 00:06:41.760
thoughts that keep coming back to you,

00:06:39.840 --> 00:06:43.840
these might be intuitive messages trying

00:06:41.760 --> 00:06:45.320
to reach you through the only channel

00:06:43.840 --> 00:06:47.240
that isn't cluttered with external

00:06:45.320 --> 00:06:49.400
noise, which is your subconscious mind.

00:06:47.240 --> 00:06:52.160
And your subconscious rules over 80 or

00:06:49.400 --> 00:06:53.840
even 90% of your entire being. You

00:06:52.160 --> 00:06:55.840
simply can access it better while you're

00:06:53.840 --> 00:06:57.480
sleeping because it's not filled with

00:06:55.840 --> 00:06:59.240
all kinds of stuff all the time. And

00:06:57.480 --> 00:07:00.960
then when you wake up, write down

00:06:59.240 --> 00:07:01.960
immediately whatever you can remember of

00:07:00.960 --> 00:07:03.320
your dream because you're going to

00:07:01.960 --> 00:07:05.440
forget it in the first five to 10

00:07:03.320 --> 00:07:07.919
minutes. And then if a daydream keeps

00:07:05.440 --> 00:07:09.720
calling out to you, don't resist it or

00:07:07.919 --> 00:07:11.680
shut it down, but notice what it's

00:07:09.720 --> 00:07:13.960
showing you, and maybe write it down,

00:07:11.680 --> 00:07:16.080
too. The more you practice remembering

00:07:13.960 --> 00:07:18.000
the messages from your subconscious, the

00:07:16.080 --> 00:07:20.040
stronger of a dialogue that you can

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:21.080
create with your higher self. And notice

00:07:20.040 --> 00:07:23.040
things that keep coming up,

00:07:21.080 --> 00:07:24.640
synchronicities especially. You know,

00:07:23.040 --> 00:07:26.640
like those moments when you think of

00:07:24.640 --> 00:07:28.760
someone and then they text you, or you

00:07:26.640 --> 00:07:31.000
see them walk by you, or when you keep

00:07:28.760 --> 00:07:33.200
seeing the same numbers or symbols keep

00:07:31.000 --> 00:07:34.560
coming up multiple times in the day, or

00:07:33.200 --> 00:07:36.840
if you keep running into the same kinds

00:07:34.560 --> 00:07:38.919
of situations. I truly do not believe in

00:07:36.840 --> 00:07:40.520
coincidences. They might be the universe

00:07:38.919 --> 00:07:42.760
or your higher self nudging you in a

00:07:40.520 --> 00:07:44.160
specific direction. And if you choose to

00:07:42.760 --> 00:07:46.840
just dismiss it, then you're going to

00:07:44.160 --> 00:07:48.240
miss a message. I always actually notice

00:07:46.840 --> 00:07:50.880
that whenever I know that I need to have

00:07:48.240 --> 00:07:52.800
closure with someone, I will literally

00:07:50.880 --> 00:07:55.040
see them across the street looking right

00:07:52.800 --> 00:07:57.040
at me at some point. So, start noticing

00:07:55.040 --> 00:07:59.560
that. Whenever something feels like a

00:07:57.040 --> 00:08:01.840
meaningful coincidence, don't dismiss it

00:07:59.560 --> 00:08:04.000
and ask yourself, "What might this mean?

00:08:01.840 --> 00:08:06.040
What could this be pointing me towards?"

00:08:04.000 --> 00:08:08.120
And learn to move your body mindfully.

00:08:06.040 --> 00:08:10.680
These mindful physical practices can

00:08:08.120 --> 00:08:12.520
look like yoga, even dancing, or even

00:08:10.680 --> 00:08:14.560
just walking with more intention. You're

00:08:12.520 --> 00:08:17.400
enhancing your intuition when you

00:08:14.560 --> 00:08:19.440
combine physical bodily presence with

00:08:17.400 --> 00:08:21.400
your awareness. I love interpretive

00:08:19.440 --> 00:08:22.960
dancing choreography, and I don't even

00:08:21.400 --> 00:08:24.960
know how to do it properly. I just do

00:08:22.960 --> 00:08:26.360
it, and it's so funny when I do it. So,

00:08:24.960 --> 00:08:28.280
I do this alone in private so nobody

00:08:26.360 --> 00:08:29.520
will make fun of me or judge me. But, if

00:08:28.280 --> 00:08:31.400
someone does see me and laughs at me,

00:08:29.520 --> 00:08:33.640
then we can laugh together. I find that

00:08:31.400 --> 00:08:35.520
whenever I do mindful movement, I'm able

00:08:33.640 --> 00:08:37.880
to do other things better like daydream

00:08:35.520 --> 00:08:39.360
better, visualize, fantasize better,

00:08:37.880 --> 00:08:41.760
which makes me a more powerful

00:08:39.360 --> 00:08:43.960
manifestor. And your intuition gets

00:08:41.760 --> 00:08:46.320
louder and louder the more embodied you

00:08:43.960 --> 00:08:48.520
are. So, embodiment means that you're

00:08:46.320 --> 00:08:50.480
actually fully living in your body. But,

00:08:48.520 --> 00:08:52.480
most of us live up here, by the way, in

00:08:50.480 --> 00:08:53.839
our heads all day. That's why they call

00:08:52.480 --> 00:08:55.440
people neurotic because they're

00:08:53.839 --> 00:08:57.080
constantly up here, and they're

00:08:55.440 --> 00:08:58.600
disconnected from the neck down, and

00:08:57.080 --> 00:09:00.520
that's really not where your intuition

00:08:58.600 --> 00:09:02.320
lives. It's a very much nervous system,

00:09:00.520 --> 00:09:04.200
physical body. And learn to trust your

00:09:02.320 --> 00:09:06.120
gut even when it doesn't make sense or

00:09:04.200 --> 00:09:07.720
feel logical. And I know this is hard,

00:09:06.120 --> 00:09:09.560
and I get it because we've been trained

00:09:07.720 --> 00:09:12.120
to override our gut feelings with

00:09:09.560 --> 00:09:14.480
rational thinking and logic. And as much

00:09:12.120 --> 00:09:17.200
as the world needs logic, I guess, to

00:09:14.480 --> 00:09:19.040
function, I hate it because it really

00:09:17.200 --> 00:09:21.800
keeps you in line, you know? It keeps

00:09:19.040 --> 00:09:24.360
you in a certain box. You have to

00:09:21.800 --> 00:09:26.200
question yourself, like, "Who invented

00:09:24.360 --> 00:09:28.960
that kind of thinking? Who does it

00:09:26.200 --> 00:09:30.720
serve?" Sometimes your intuition picks

00:09:28.960 --> 00:09:33.400
up on certain things that your conscious

00:09:30.720 --> 00:09:35.080
mind can't even see yet, and that

00:09:33.400 --> 00:09:37.080
illogical feeling can actually be the

00:09:35.080 --> 00:09:39.320
most intelligent response that you have

00:09:37.080 --> 00:09:41.440
because when you look back on something

00:09:39.320 --> 00:09:43.040
where you had a weird gut feeling about

00:09:41.440 --> 00:09:44.280
and you don't follow it and then

00:09:43.040 --> 00:09:46.920
something terrible happens and you look

00:09:44.280 --> 00:09:48.360
back and you're like, I knew before I

00:09:46.920 --> 00:09:49.400
even experienced it. So if you don't

00:09:48.360 --> 00:09:51.320
know what I'm talking about, you can

00:09:49.400 --> 00:09:52.480
start small and live in your body more

00:09:51.320 --> 00:09:54.880
than in your head and you can start

00:09:52.480 --> 00:09:57.440
there. So then eventually when your gut

00:09:54.880 --> 00:09:59.800
says something is off, take note of it

00:09:57.440 --> 00:10:01.800
and see what happens if you do follow

00:09:59.800 --> 00:10:03.160
that gut feeling. Eventually you're

00:10:01.800 --> 00:10:05.320
going to build more and more evidence

00:10:03.160 --> 00:10:07.360
that your intuition can be trusted.

00:10:05.320 --> 00:10:09.040
Especially if your gut says walk away

00:10:07.360 --> 00:10:10.920
and you do and then nothing bad happens

00:10:09.040 --> 00:10:12.400
to you, then that's it working because

00:10:10.920 --> 00:10:14.640
your intuition is always right. And

00:10:12.400 --> 00:10:16.680
sometimes especially in the beginning,

00:10:14.640 --> 00:10:18.080
you may need some additional support.

00:10:16.680 --> 00:10:19.960
Not someone to try and tell you what to

00:10:18.080 --> 00:10:22.320
do but to help you hear yourself more

00:10:19.960 --> 00:10:24.120
clearly and confirm what your gut and

00:10:22.320 --> 00:10:25.480
your subconscious mind is telling you.

00:10:24.120 --> 00:10:27.200
This is where Nebula comes in and

00:10:25.480 --> 00:10:29.080
they're the sponsor of today's video.

00:10:27.200 --> 00:10:31.680
Nebula is a spiritual guidance space

00:10:29.080 --> 00:10:33.640
designed for deeper self-discovery. I

00:10:31.680 --> 00:10:35.640
like to use my natal chart for example

00:10:33.640 --> 00:10:37.960
to see my own alignment to my true

00:10:35.640 --> 00:10:39.960
nature before the world told me who to

00:10:37.960 --> 00:10:41.520
be. Basically confirming what you

00:10:39.960 --> 00:10:43.280
already know deep down but you haven't

00:10:41.520 --> 00:10:45.600
been able to access it. So if I ever

00:10:43.280 --> 00:10:47.160
need confirmation, I can always message

00:10:45.600 --> 00:10:49.480
one of their spiritual advisors who are

00:10:47.160 --> 00:10:51.600
available 24/7 and they also have the

00:10:49.480 --> 00:10:53.240
experience to help you filter the noise

00:10:51.600 --> 00:10:55.160
and explain certain things to you. Then

00:10:53.240 --> 00:10:56.800
you can practice having your gut tell

00:10:55.160 --> 00:10:58.520
you whether you're on the right track or

00:10:56.800 --> 00:11:00.400
not. My link to Nebula is in the

00:10:58.520 --> 00:11:02.000
description. There is a short quiz that

00:11:00.400 --> 00:11:03.960
matches you with advisors who resonate

00:11:02.000 --> 00:11:05.760
with your energy. You also get the first

00:11:03.960 --> 00:11:07.280
few minutes for free so you can check it

00:11:05.760 --> 00:11:08.800
out and let me know if it helps you. And

00:11:07.280 --> 00:11:10.839
then write things down without filtering

00:11:08.800 --> 00:11:12.360
yourself. Your conscious mind is full of

00:11:10.839 --> 00:11:14.680
other people's opinions, other people's

00:11:12.360 --> 00:11:17.080
voices but your subconscious is where

00:11:14.680 --> 00:11:19.280
your truth lives. So practice grabbing a

00:11:17.080 --> 00:11:20.560
pen and a notebook. This is my practice

00:11:19.280 --> 00:11:22.800
notebook from my merch store by the way,

00:11:20.560 --> 00:11:24.440
I designed this. And just ask yourself,

00:11:22.800 --> 00:11:26.200
what do I actually need right now? And

00:11:24.440 --> 00:11:28.440
then just write for 5 minutes without

00:11:26.200 --> 00:11:30.320
stopping. Do not edit yourself, don't

00:11:28.440 --> 00:11:31.840
filter out whatever you're thinking and

00:11:30.320 --> 00:11:34.200
don't try to make it sound good or

00:11:31.840 --> 00:11:35.960
correct, or have any kind of standards.

00:11:34.200 --> 00:11:38.120
Have zero expectations. Just keep

00:11:35.960 --> 00:11:40.160
writing. And as you write, intuitive

00:11:38.120 --> 00:11:41.720
insights will appear to you eventually.

00:11:40.160 --> 00:11:42.960
Maybe you suddenly get clarity on

00:11:41.720 --> 00:11:44.960
something. Things that you didn't even

00:11:42.960 --> 00:11:46.960
know that you knew until you saw them on

00:11:44.960 --> 00:11:48.840
that page. Another thing that I actually

00:11:46.960 --> 00:11:50.320
noticed during my therapy sessions is

00:11:48.840 --> 00:11:53.440
whenever I'm trying to talk through my

00:11:50.320 --> 00:11:55.240
situation, I somehow already know the

00:11:53.440 --> 00:11:57.360
answer in my head before my therapist

00:11:55.240 --> 00:12:00.000
even says a word to me. And then what I

00:11:57.360 --> 00:12:01.360
would do next is basically talk myself

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:03.280
through that solution to see if it

00:12:01.360 --> 00:12:04.880
sounds right. But don't filter yourself,

00:12:03.280 --> 00:12:07.120
especially not through the lens of

00:12:04.880 --> 00:12:09.160
whether something is moral or not,

00:12:07.120 --> 00:12:11.360
because morality is yet another thing

00:12:09.160 --> 00:12:14.000
that humans invented to keep you on a

00:12:11.360 --> 00:12:16.240
binary, either good or bad, and our

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:18.320
humanity is a lot more nuanced than

00:12:16.240 --> 00:12:20.800
that. And then lastly, I love keeping an

00:12:18.320 --> 00:12:22.840
intuition log. Get a small notebook,

00:12:20.800 --> 00:12:24.480
even the one that I have, for example.

00:12:22.840 --> 00:12:26.960
Every time you have a gut feeling, a

00:12:24.480 --> 00:12:29.560
vivid dream, or synchronicity, a moment

00:12:26.960 --> 00:12:31.800
where you just know something, anything,

00:12:29.560 --> 00:12:33.640
write it down. Take note of the day,

00:12:31.800 --> 00:12:35.680
write the day down, and describe it. And

00:12:33.640 --> 00:12:37.880
then later, you can come back to it and

00:12:35.680 --> 00:12:39.839
notice what happened. Over time, the

00:12:37.880 --> 00:12:41.560
more you do this, you're going to notice

00:12:39.839 --> 00:12:44.280
certain patterns coming up. You start

00:12:41.560 --> 00:12:46.640
seeing that your intuition was right

00:12:44.280 --> 00:12:48.800
more often than you realized, and that

00:12:46.640 --> 00:12:50.960
evidence builds more trust. Trust builds

00:12:48.800 --> 00:12:53.360
confidence, and confidence makes you

00:12:50.960 --> 00:12:55.120
dangerous. When you're a very intuitive

00:12:53.360 --> 00:12:56.839
person, you will start learning how much

00:12:55.120 --> 00:12:58.280
of it was actually buried before you

00:12:56.839 --> 00:13:00.080
learned how to build it in the first

00:12:58.280 --> 00:13:02.040
place. Under all these years of people

00:13:00.080 --> 00:13:04.120
pleasing, the need to be liked and to be

00:13:02.040 --> 00:13:05.720
validated, and also under the fear that

00:13:04.120 --> 00:13:07.320
if you actually listen to yourself, you

00:13:05.720 --> 00:13:09.480
might have to change something about how

00:13:07.320 --> 00:13:12.160
you live your life. And maybe you do.

00:13:09.480 --> 00:13:13.800
That is why intuition is so dangerous.

00:13:12.160 --> 00:13:16.120
Not because it's wrong, but because it's

00:13:13.800 --> 00:13:17.560
the truth. So, tell me in the comments,

00:13:16.120 --> 00:13:19.080
what is one thing that your intuition

00:13:17.560 --> 00:13:20.560
has been trying to tell you that you've

00:13:19.080 --> 00:13:22.080
been ignoring? I would love to learn

00:13:20.560 --> 00:13:23.760
this and hear your thoughts, but keep in

00:13:22.080 --> 00:13:26.080
mind that someone who trusts themselves

00:13:23.760 --> 00:13:27.680
completely is literally so much harder

00:13:26.080 --> 00:13:29.720
to manipulate and so much harder to

00:13:27.680 --> 00:13:31.960
control. After a while, you'll stop

00:13:29.720 --> 00:13:33.720
learning to ask everyone about what you

00:13:31.960 --> 00:13:36.040
should be doing and instead learn to

00:13:33.720 --> 00:13:37.960
hear your higher self and your guides

00:13:36.040 --> 00:13:39.920
tell you the truth. And if you want to

00:13:37.960 --> 00:13:41.640
be in a community of lovely people who

00:13:39.920 --> 00:13:43.680
are also working on themselves, you can

00:13:41.640 --> 00:13:45.000
join my Stoic Angels Discord server. And

00:13:43.680 --> 00:13:46.640
I hope you find this video helpful.

00:13:45.000 --> 00:13:50.200
Thank you so much for watching and I

00:13:46.640 --> 00:13:50.200
will see you in the next video.

